WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.530 --> 00:00:06.910
We have a voicemail number two, one nine two
David P. this color has the idea of a citizen's

00:00:06.910 --> 00:00:08.780
arrest on Donald Trump.

00:00:08.780 --> 00:00:10.059
Let's take a listen.

00:00:10.059 --> 00:00:11.980
Hi, I'm calling from Connecticut.

00:00:11.980 --> 00:00:13.400
My name is Kelly.

00:00:13.400 --> 00:00:21.240
Um, I have a very strange question and I'm,
I don't know if this is possible or not, but

00:00:21.240 --> 00:00:26.800
I'd like to know, could I make a citizen's
arrest?

00:00:26.800 --> 00:00:34.999
Could I have Donald Trump arrested for several
things that I can think of a whole bunch of

00:00:34.999 --> 00:00:36.749
off the top of my head.

00:00:36.749 --> 00:00:39.480
I would really like to know what the laws
are on that.

00:00:39.480 --> 00:00:46.300
What, why can't we do something about the
blatant breaking of our laws?

00:00:46.300 --> 00:00:49.629
It's the things that he exhibits on a daily
basis.

00:00:49.629 --> 00:00:52.019
Just wondering, just throwing it out there.

00:00:52.019 --> 00:00:54.749
I'd be willing to sign up for it.

00:00:54.749 --> 00:00:57.749
I'd be willing to figure out a way to do it.

00:00:57.749 --> 00:00:58.749
Yeah.

00:00:58.749 --> 00:01:00.110
Listen, um, citizens arrest is something that
exists there.

00:01:00.110 --> 00:01:04.809
There are situations where private individuals
have the power to make an arrest without a

00:01:04.809 --> 00:01:05.809
warrant.

00:01:05.809 --> 00:01:07.100
These are known as citizens arrests.

00:01:07.100 --> 00:01:11.500
Typically they are when just normal people
will detain a criminal themselves or direct

00:01:11.500 --> 00:01:14.799
police officers to detain a criminal or whatever
the case may be.

00:01:14.799 --> 00:01:19.280
Um, I think that it is not a good use of time
thinking about how to citizens arrest Donald

00:01:19.280 --> 00:01:23.789
Trump, whatever the legal questions are about
citizens arresting a president, you're not

00:01:23.789 --> 00:01:25.520
going to be able to get close to the president.

00:01:25.520 --> 00:01:28.570
What would secret service protection and everything
else that is going on?

00:01:28.570 --> 00:01:32.009
Uh, we don't even know if the president can
be arrested in a normal way.

00:01:32.009 --> 00:01:35.579
It's sort of a matter of a high level legal
discussions.

00:01:35.579 --> 00:01:39.299
My suggestion is I would not think too much
about this.

00:01:39.299 --> 00:01:41.640
I would think about other forms of activism.

00:01:41.640 --> 00:01:43.789
I understand your frustrations.

00:01:43.789 --> 00:01:45.090
I understand what you're saying.

00:01:45.090 --> 00:01:49.869
You, if you tried this would likely end up
being charged for attacking the president

00:01:49.869 --> 00:01:51.620
and you might actually end up in jail or prison.

00:01:51.620 --> 00:01:54.979
I'm not saying that's the right thing, but
what I'm telling you is that is the most likely

00:01:54.979 --> 00:01:55.979
outcome.

00:01:55.979 --> 00:01:57.409
I wouldn't do it if I were you.

